            <fr:title text="Nullable Grammar">Nullable Grammar</fr:title>
            <fr:taxon>Definition</fr:taxon>
          </fr:frontmatter>
          <fr:mainmatter>
            <html:p>
  A grammar <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[A]]></fr:tex> is nullable if the empty string belongs to the language of <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[A]]></fr:tex>.
</html:p>
